## Code Generation Rules

- Follow the coding standards in `AGENTS.md` §Coding Standards
- All new code must have tests per `AGENTS.md` §Testing Policy
- Commit messages: `type(scope): summary` (see `AGENTS.md` §Commit Convention)
- Branch naming: `task/#NNN-short-description`
- Gate before commit: `./scripts/check-all.sh L1`
- Gate before push: `./scripts/check-all.sh L2`

## Do Not Generate

- Code that violates any invariant listed in `AGENTS.md` §Invariants
- Tests that mock internal APIs or databases
- `any` type casts in TypeScript without explicit justification
- Direct commits to `main` — always use a task branch
